{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You\u2019re not just running a video rental store. You\u2019re running out of time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/1388857de895b08a9365485b2ba55650.poster.avif?t=1768523485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/1388857de895b08a9365485b2ba55650.webm?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/1388857de895b08a9365485b2ba55650.mp4?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>RUN THE WORLD'S LAST VIDEO RENTAL STORE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just inherited a failing video rental store - the last one in town. You have no cash, late returns to collect, and worse yet, streaming giants RentNet just moved in down the street. Rent tapes by day, hustle by night, and do whatever it takes to keep the lights on in a world that\u2019s already moved on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order movies, snacks, toys, and games to fill your shelves with the goods. Keep products stocked, help customers at checkout, and hire employees to streamline operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/2181b7852ad6bba2eec33b9b25001837.poster.avif?t=1768523485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/2181b7852ad6bba2eec33b9b25001837.webm?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/2181b7852ad6bba2eec33b9b25001837.mp4?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hustle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrape together cash by any means necessary. Run a Fight Club in the store basement, gamble your last dollar on scratcher lottery tickets, and take the Reshoot Springs by storm with various side hustles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/278bf96be9b76fd7cbdf821eda95d214.poster.avif?t=1768523485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/278bf96be9b76fd7cbdf821eda95d214.webm?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/278bf96be9b76fd7cbdf821eda95d214.mp4?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Profit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct and craft Rewind 99 original films to compete with RentNet and rake in that box office dough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/17e7ba8b227229d4e41ca772d794f32c.poster.avif?t=1768523485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/17e7ba8b227229d4e41ca772d794f32c.webm?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/17e7ba8b227229d4e41ca772d794f32c.mp4?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a lived-in, low-poly city by foot or scooter - uncover secrets, stalk NPC schedules, and unlock shady side hustles. The better your store does, the weirder things get. All with<strong> co-op multiplayer</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/a85812d1575242509ccb2f9c3d333f55.poster.avif?t=1768523485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/a85812d1575242509ccb2f9c3d333f55.webm?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/a85812d1575242509ccb2f9c3d333f55.mp4?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No generative AI was used in the making of this game.\u00a0We pay artists for all our assets and marketing images/ videos,  devs, etc. We are proud to be a 100% human-made game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3977290?t=1768523485","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/4957e695f3ad4e5353b7228bba899249b065b1cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768523485","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/1e83d0eba69c7b6dccf549331848dfd365799fc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768523485","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/1e83d0eba69c7b6dccf549331848dfd365799fc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768523485","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game depicts non-realistic violence in the form of melee combat."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You\u2019re not just running a video rental store. You\u2019re running out of time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/1388857de895b08a9365485b2ba55650.poster.avif?t=1768523485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/1388857de895b08a9365485b2ba55650.webm?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/1388857de895b08a9365485b2ba55650.mp4?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>RUN THE WORLD'S LAST VIDEO RENTAL STORE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just inherited a failing video rental store - the last one in town. You have no cash, late returns to collect, and worse yet, streaming giants RentNet just moved in down the street. Rent tapes by day, hustle by night, and do whatever it takes to keep the lights on in a world that\u2019s already moved on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order movies, snacks, toys, and games to fill your shelves with the goods. Keep products stocked, help customers at checkout, and hire employees to streamline operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/2181b7852ad6bba2eec33b9b25001837.poster.avif?t=1768523485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/2181b7852ad6bba2eec33b9b25001837.webm?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/2181b7852ad6bba2eec33b9b25001837.mp4?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hustle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrape together cash by any means necessary. Run a Fight Club in the store basement, gamble your last dollar on scratcher lottery tickets, and take the Reshoot Springs by storm with various side hustles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/278bf96be9b76fd7cbdf821eda95d214.poster.avif?t=1768523485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/278bf96be9b76fd7cbdf821eda95d214.webm?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/278bf96be9b76fd7cbdf821eda95d214.mp4?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Profit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct and craft Rewind 99 original films to compete with RentNet and rake in that box office dough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/17e7ba8b227229d4e41ca772d794f32c.poster.avif?t=1768523485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/17e7ba8b227229d4e41ca772d794f32c.webm?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/17e7ba8b227229d4e41ca772d794f32c.mp4?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a lived-in, low-poly city by foot or scooter - uncover secrets, stalk NPC schedules, and unlock shady side hustles. The better your store does, the weirder things get. All with<strong> co-op multiplayer</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/a85812d1575242509ccb2f9c3d333f55.poster.avif?t=1768523485\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/a85812d1575242509ccb2f9c3d333f55.webm?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/a85812d1575242509ccb2f9c3d333f55.mp4?t=1768523485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No generative AI was used in the making of this game.\u00a0We pay artists for all our assets and marketing images/ videos,  devs, etc. We are proud to be a 100% human-made game.</p>","developers":["Gunmetal Games","Real Fake Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/027fdbc9a353708547f7452dd1395054bdc8afa1/header.jpg?t=1768523485","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video